          4000
        ],
        "extraChancePerLevel": 0.04
      }
    }
  },
  "combat": {
    "_description": "Idle combat (docs/idle-mode.md): the last kind of monster an idle player attacked and killed is the target; the character attacks the nearest one around where it started, eats below eatBelowPercent hitpoints, stops when out of food below stopBelowPercent, and banks the loot. Kills come slower than gathers: maxGapSeconds is the longest wait between two kills that keeps one offline session.",
